1
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:51,520
It seems Miss Tang

2
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:53,280
not only plays the pipa well,

3
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,240
but is also extremely smart.

4
00:01:55,759 --> 00:01:57,759
I still have to thank you, Prince Yu.

5
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:59,759
Thanks to your decoy plan,

6
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,120
I was able to escape.

7
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:03,320
When I sent you the message,

8
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:05,240
I thought you wouldn't act on impulse.

9
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:07,240
I didn't expect it to go so smoothly.

10
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:12,400
Where are we going?

11
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,480
I'll take you out of the city first.

12
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:16,800
I have a manor in the suburbs.

13
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,680
You can hide there for a few days

14
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,480
to lay low.

15
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:23,880
I have no way to repay your great kindness, Your Highness.

16
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,770
I can only pray for your health and success every day.

17
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,170
You're too kind.

18
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,890
You consider me a soulmate.

19
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,530
How could I just ignore you?

20
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:36,920
If Miss Tang needs anything in the future,

21
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:37,880
just ask.

22
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:40,290
I will definitely grant your request.

23
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:50,079
Hyah!

24
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:58,370
Your Highness, someone is coming.

25
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,640
I'll go back with them.

26
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,540
I can't implicate you.

27
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:17,079
If we fight to the death,

28
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,360
we might have a chance.

29
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,240
Sixth Brother, you came so fast.

30
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:55,420
Did you know Miss Tang and I were leaving the city

31
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:56,960
and came to see us off?

32
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:02,920
Miss Tang,

33
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:06,920
remember I said I would grant any request.

34
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:14,200
You really are my good sixth brother.

35
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:32,840
It's getting late.

36
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,570
Please go back, Your Highness.

37
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:40,620
You want me to leave so you can find Yuwen Jia.

38
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,650
And have him help you escape again, right?

39
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:45,770
I wouldn't dare.

40
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,480
You wouldn't dare? What wouldn't you dare to do?

41
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,240
Faking your death to escape.

42
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,520
And standing with him.

43
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:56,930
Your Highness seems to have never heard me play the pipa.

44
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,180
How about this?

45
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,650
I will play a tune for Your Highness today.

46
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:31,960
What a great poem, 'Going out to the Frontier'.

47
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:34,020
You mean you want me to let you go home.

48
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:38,000
Since Your Highness understands my meaning,

49
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,640
why can't you grant my wish?

50
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,580
Don't even think about it.

51
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,159
I finally got you back.

52
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:45,340
I won't let you leave so easily again.

53
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:50,920
Isn't this face what Your Highness likes?

54
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,250
I will destroy it today,

55
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:54,610
so Your Highness won't desire it anymore.

56
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,620
Let's talk it over.

57
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,120
Don't hurt yourself.

58
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,360
If I don't hurt myself,

59
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,560
should I just let you hurt me?

60
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:07,960
No.

61
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,460
It's not like that.

62
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,380
Just because of this face.

63
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:15,010
To satisfy your perverted desires

64
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:16,810
and comfort your dark longing.

65
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,520
Are you going to take in all the women in the world

66
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:20,000
as long as they look like her,

67
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,360
and trample on them at will?

68
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,480
What on earth are you talking about?

69
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:39,720
No wonder he said those inexplicable things that day.

70
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,320
He knew you were right there.

71
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,940
He was trying to drive a wedge between us.

72
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,880
Prince Yu treats me with sincerity.

73
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:49,840
Unlike you.

74
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,720
I don't trust him.

75
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:52,880
Should I trust you?

76
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:53,340
Zhiluo.

77
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,840
Are you treating the target as Miss Tang

78
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:09,840
or Yuwen Jia?

79
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,820
I really can't stand you people trapped by love.

80
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,800
It's better to be free and alone.

81
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,330
Why are you so talkative today?

82
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:27,040
Have the accounts from the 13 families in the northwest been collected?

83
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,240
There was internal strife in Rouran,

84
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,240
so it was delayed.

85
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:31,410
I was just about to go there myself.

86
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,700
Speaking of Miss Tang,

87
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,280
it's only been two years,

88
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:40,880
but her temper and disposition are completely different.

89
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:42,600
If it weren't for the birthmark as proof,

90
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:45,460
I really wouldn't believe they are the same person.

91
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:48,760
You see, this Miss Tang,

92
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:52,520
she had such a good temper when she was a female physician,

93
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,280
but you didn't know how to cherish her.

94
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,280
Are you happy now?

95
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,800
You gave it all back, didn't you?

96
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,800
You deserve it.

97
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,060
What's wrong with you?

98
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,600
Zhiluo.

99
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,080
I'm sorry.

100
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,400
If I hadn't slipped,

101
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:43,600
you wouldn't have...

102
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:45,810
Wouldn't have what?

103
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:59,480
I'm sorry. I lost control.

104
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,740
Don't stay behind me anymore.

105
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,850
I'm afraid you'll be in danger.

106
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:31,880
Psycho.
